  "bio": "Taz Maya is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Montigny-lès-Metz, France, renowned for their expertise in fineline, geometric, and minimalist tattoo designs. With a keen eye for detail, Taz specializes in the precise and intricate art of microrealism and dotwork, ensuring each piece is a masterpiece of clean and refined lines. Dedicated to providing a safe and inclusive environment for all clients, Taz upholds the highest standards of professionalism in their craft.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Montigny-lès-metz, Grand Est, France\n\n— Micro-réalisme \n🏆 tatouages avec l’aiguille la plus fine au monde\n📍METZ 💌\n tazmayatattoo@gmail.com \n📍guest artist around the world 🌍",
